      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788201027350,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "TTL Expirations\n- Whenever we get() we check the time, if expired, we delete it and return null\n- Janitor: We also will have a janitor service that runs periodically to remove expired\n\nLRU Eviction Policy\n- LinkedList & Capacity\n- Front of List is recently accessed, Tail of List is least recently used\n\nReplication\n- We will need a mechanism to promote a replica to leader if the replica fails \n- Check what updates were missed when leader was down.\n\nHigh Performance Strategies\n- Write Batching (reducing network calls)\n- Consistent Hashing w/ Replicas (Read & Write)\n- Key & Suffix - for reads\n",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "TTL Expirations\n- Whenever we get() we check the time, if expired, we delete it and return null\n- Janitor: We also will have a janitor service that runs periodically to remove expired\n\nLRU Eviction Policy\n- LinkedList & Capacity\n- Front of List is recently accessed, Tail of List is least recently used\n\nReplication\n- We will need a mechanism to promote a replica to leader if the replica fails \n- Check what updates were missed when leader was down.\n\nHigh Performance Strategies\n- Write Batching (reducing network calls)\n- Consistent Hashing w/ Replicas (Read & Write)\n- Key & Suffix - for reads\n",
      "lineHeight": 1.2,
      "baseline": 259,
      "index": "ag",
      "autoResize": true
    },
